ENTED VEHICLE TITLE PROCESSING.'}{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2021-04-01 09:00:00', 'title': 'CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE COLLABORATES WITH GINKGO BIOWORKS TO BOLSTER CROP PROTECTION', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS AND BOSTON, APRIL 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE LLC\xa0(NYSE: CTVA), A LEADING PURE-PLAY AGRICULTURE COMPANY, AND GINKGO BIOWORKS, INC. ("GINKGO")\xa0THE ORGANISM COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO A MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT TO APPLY THE POWER OF SYNTHETIC BIOLOGY TO DESIGN INNOVATIVE CROP PROTECTION TECHNOLOGIES. THIS COLLABORATION COMBINES CORTEVA\'S DEEP KNOWLEDGE OF NATURAL PRODUCT DISCOVERY AND AGRICULTURAL EXPERTISE WITH GINKGO\'S EXTENSIVE CELL ENGINEERING PLATFORM AND DNA CODEBASE TO EXPLORE THE NEXT GENERATION OF NATURALLY-INSPIRED SUSTAINABLE SOLUTIONS.'}{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2021-04-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'CVS HEALTH SURPASSES 10 MILLION COVID-19 VACCINE DOSES ADMINISTERED', 'text': 'WOONSOCKET, R.I., APRIL 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CVS HEALTH (NYSE: CVS) HAS SURPASSED 10 MILLION COVID-19 VACCINE DOSES ADMINISTERED THROUGH ITS PARTICIPATION IN THE PHARMACY PARTNERSHIP FOR LONG-TERM CARE PROGRAM\xa0AND FEDERAL RETAIL PHARMACY PROGRAM.'}{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2021-04-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'MASN AND NBC REGIONAL SPORTS NETWORKS REMOVED FROM DISH TV, SLING TV', 'text': 'ENGLEWOOD, COLO., APRIL 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0\xa0MASN AND NBC REGIONAL SPORTS NETWORKS (RSNS) WERE REMOVED FROM DISH TV AND SLING TV LAST NIGHT, AFFECTING ACCESS IN 10 STATES AND WASHINGTON D.C.'}{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2021-04-01 11:15:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY OFFERS $1 MILLION IN CRITICAL COMMUNITY NEEDS GRANTS', 'text': "RICHMOND, VA., APRIL 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOMINION ENERGY IS INVITING NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS ACROSS THE COMPANY'S FOOTPRINT TO APPLY FOR GRANTS OF UP TO $25,000 EACH TO MEET CRITICAL NEEDS IN COMMUNITIES."}{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2021-04-01 09:27:00', 'title': "DTE'S ENERGY EFFICIENCY ASSISTANCE PROGRAM HELPS 5,000 CU